invariant: INV-5
file: x509_pem.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: an EC PRIVATE KEY block without its parameters field decodes, but
  outside PKCS #8 nothing else names the curve, and RFC 5915 section 3
  requires the field there. test_key_files writes that file and requires
  CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    return read_ec_private_key(der, der_len, CURVE_REQUIRED, scalar, point);
--- new
    return read_ec_private_key(der, der_len, CURVE_OPTIONAL, scalar, point);
